.................... ////     compatibility).                                               //// 
.................... ////                                                                   //// 
.................... //// Nov 13th, 2009:                                                   //// 
.................... ////  usb_endpoint_is_valid() prototyped.                              //// 
.................... ////                                                                   //// 
.................... //// March 5th, 2009:                                                  //// 
.................... ////   Cleanup for Wizard.                                             //// 
.................... ////   PIC24 Initial release.                                          //// 
.................... ////                                                                   //// 
.................... //// July 13th, 2005:                                                  //// 
.................... ////  usb_ep_tx_size[] and usb_ep_rx_size[] changed to 16bits          //// 
.................... ////                                                                   //// 
.................... //// June 20th, 2005:                                                  //// 
.................... ////  Initial 18fxx5x release                                          //// 
.................... ////                                                                   //// 
.................... //// May 13th, 2005:                                                   //// 
.................... ////  Beta release, only works with 18Fxx5x hardware layer.            //// 
