.................... ////   WITH 18F4550)                                                   //// 
.................... ////  usb_gets() and usb_puts() changed (see usb.c)                    //// 
.................... ////                                                                   //// 
.................... //// June 24th, 2004:                                                  //// 
.................... ////  Optimization and cleanup.                                        //// 
.................... ////                The following definitions changed:                 //// 
.................... ////  USB_EPx_TX_ENABLE and USB_EPx_RX_ENABLE have changed. See usb.h  //// 
.................... ////  USB_CONFIG_DESCRIPTORS[] removed                                 //// 
